1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:14,484
[Host] Welcome to Japanese Daily News. I'm Maya. Today is October ninth. This morning: the first frost and ice of the autumn in the mountains north of Tokyo. Let's listen.

2
00:00:15,083 --> 00:00:18,036
